	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12672"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=420" title="View the profile of Tiiden">Tiiden</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 49<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://forum.magecompendium.com/images/avatars/12385452393e812c24ac839.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								The Last of the Magicians!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=420"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.convictioneq.com" title="Conviction" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1264.msg12672#msg12672"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1264.msg12672#msg12672">Re: Omens broke my boxes!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #7 on:</b> November 15, 2004, 04:29:56 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							If your PC is randomly rebooting, it&#039;s quite possible that you&#039;re having a problem with heat, which is most likely caused by dust.&nbsp; Pop open your case and bust out the canned air on it, make sure all the dust and dirt gets out of the video card and CPU heatsinks / fans.&nbsp; If too much dust gets in them it impairs the airflow and causes the chips to get extremely hot.&nbsp; Most newer PC&#039;s have overheating protection built into the motherboard, which coincidentally, usually reboots your machine automatically when the cpu temp gets over a certain point.<br /><br />Of course there are a number of other things that could be causing it - bad memory, software bugs, incorrect settings, user error, Bill Gates hates you, etc.&nbsp; But, in my experince very few users clean out their cases, and very few realize the problems dirt and dust can cause.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=370607" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.geocities.com/tiideneq/tiidensig.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br />70 Magician, Officer of&nbsp; <a href="http://www.convictioneq.com/" target="_blank">&lt;Conviction&gt;</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
