	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12701"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=420" title="View the profile of Tiiden">Tiiden</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 49<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://forum.magecompendium.com/images/avatars/12385452393e812c24ac839.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								The Last of the Magicians!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=420"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.convictioneq.com" title="Conviction" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1264.msg12701#msg12701"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1264.msg12701#msg12701">Re: Omens broke my boxes!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #9 on:</b> November 16, 2004, 04:36:08 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							How much RAM do you have installed?&nbsp; Could be that one of the sticks is bad, or doesn&#039;t like your motherboard, or doesn&#039;t like the other stick.&nbsp; While Doom3 and Planetside are very graphics intensive, they won&#039;t cause you to totally fill up your memory if you&#039;ve got more than 512, but 2+ boxing in EQ sure as hell will.&nbsp; Trying setting your swap file (virtual memory) to like 10 megabytes in windows, then open up&nbsp; every program you&#039;ve got installed on your PC that runs in a winodw (don&#039;t use EQ) and watch your memory usage in the task manager.&nbsp; See if it reboots when you start to run out of physical memory.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
