	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12707"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=420" title="View the profile of Tiiden">Tiiden</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 49<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://forum.magecompendium.com/images/avatars/12385452393e812c24ac839.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								The Last of the Magicians!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=420"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.convictioneq.com" title="Conviction" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1264.msg12707#msg12707"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1264.msg12707#msg12707">Re: Omens broke my boxes!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #12 on:</b> November 17, 2004, 02:17:31 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Start -&gt; control panel -&gt; system -&gt; advanced tab -&gt; 1st &quot;settings&quot; button -&gt; advanced tab -&gt; &quot;change&quot; button -&gt; set both minimum and maximum size to 8, hit &quot;set&quot; then &quot;apply&quot; (reboot if it asks you to), and start opening every program you have, multiple times if nessecary.&nbsp; DO NOT disable virtual memory - while you would think that would be the best way to preform this kind of test, some programs reqiure virtual memory to be enabled, and will just crash because it&#039;s disabled.&nbsp; Keep opening programs till windows bitches at you that it&#039;s outta memory.&nbsp; If it reboots before then, take out a stick of RAM and do it again till it reboots.&nbsp; If It doesn&#039;t, bingo, you&#039;ve found the bad stick.&nbsp; If it does, swap sticks and try again - if it happens with both sticks then it&#039;s possible that either your motherboard doesn&#039;t like your RAM, or RAM has nothing at all to do with it, which means it&#039;s likely a configuration / driver problem&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/banghead2.gif" alt="banghead2" border="0" />.<br /><br />All RAM was not created equal&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />P.S. If you&#039;re having a hard time getting enough programs open to fill up a gig of RAM, a good way to do it is get EQ Companion and set the maximum # of lines in the prefrences menu so the memory usage is like 800 megs, restart it, and then start opening programs.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=370607" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.geocities.com/tiideneq/tiidensig.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br />70 Magician, Officer of&nbsp; <a href="http://www.convictioneq.com/" target="_blank">&lt;Conviction&gt;</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
